# NULLXES product modules (LOCKED)

| Product | Role | Not |
|---------|------|-----|
| **CERBER** | Vision / perception (Detect→Track→Fusion→WorldFact). YOLO→ONNX Runtime. | Chat LLM. Llama, Gemini, GPT, Ollama, cloud APIs. |
| **POSEIDON** | Specialist packs (CV/VE/VL/FW). Facts only. | GuidanceIntent. Product ids `qwen*`/`llama*`/`gemini*`. |
| **DMI** | DECIDE + swarm offer/claim. L0 swarm-blind. | Inner-loop. Cloud LLM. MARL onboard. |
| **BLACK ATLAS** | GSC AI+coordinator. AllocationPlan → DMI executor. | Companion default. CERBER replacement. Fire-control. |
| **BLACK DEATH** | Airframe + SoftBus autonomy stack | Cloud decision path |

## Hard rules

- Entire UAV stack (civil+military) runs **NULLXES nets** (train + export + sha). Architecture corpses (YOLO, DeepSets, Set Transformer, GAT) are references — **weights are ours**. No Qwen/Llama/Gemini/GPT/Ollama as product models.
- CERBER stays eyes (detect ONNX). No LLM in `perception/`.
- Flight path: CERBER → POSEIDON → DMI → Guidance → L0. ATLAS on GSC only.
- ATLAS-ALLOC is written in-repo (`06_autonomy/atlas/`, `models/atlas/`). No Hub download of a coordinator LLM.
- ATLAS proposes; DMI owns exclusive TaskOffer / ACCEPT / REJECT. Never GuidanceIntent.
- L0 remains swarm-blind and weapon-blind.
- Mission envelope is **CIVIL** (boot) or **DEFENSE** (operator_ack). Same L0. 30–50 km is GSC territorial COP (Remote ID / ЭРА-ГЛОНАСС / GNSS), not CERBER EO. No munition bus, no jammer/spoof emitter.
- GSC voice is **local ONNX TTS** (`nullxes_tts_v1`) with SAPI fallback. No cloud TTS. No Qwen/Llama/Gemini/GPT as a mouth.
